          preparation:
            "Understand JWT signing, expiration, storage risks, refresh tokens, and revocation strategies.",
        },
        {
          statement:
            "The token is stored in the browser.",
          risk: "High",
          reason:
            "An interviewer may challenge where the token is stored and ask about XSS and CSRF risks.",
